<article class="tm-article">
  <nav class="tm-breadcrumb"><a href="/hc/en-us">Help Center</a> / Shipping &amp; delivery</nav>

  <p>All orders are shipped from our central warehouse in Germany – Europe's largest music warehouse. Items marked <strong>in stock</strong> that are ordered before 15:00 on a weekday usually leave the same day.</p>

  <div class="tm-callout">
    <strong>Free shipping</strong> on orders from 1,100 kr to Denmark. Below that, standard shipping costs 89 kr per order, no matter how many items you buy.
  </div>

  <h2>Delivery times to Denmark</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Standard parcel:</strong> 2–4 working days after shipping.</li>
    <li><strong>Express:</strong> 1–2 working days – available at checkout for in-stock items.</li>
    <li><strong>Bulky freight</strong> (pianos, large PA systems, drum kits): 4–7 working days, delivered by a freight forwarder who calls to arrange a time.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Carriers</h2>
  <p>Parcels are delivered by GLS or PostNord depending on size and destination. You can choose home delivery or a parcel shop at checkout, and change the delivery preference in the carrier's tracking page once the parcel has been shipped.</p>

  <h2>Damaged or missing parcel</h2>
  <p>Please check the parcel before signing for it. If the packaging is visibly damaged, note it with the driver and take a photo. Then <a href="/hc/en-us/requests/new">contact us</a> within 7 days with the photos and your order number – we handle the claim with the carrier and send a replacement.</p>

